WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,071 --> 00:00:03,007
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:03,057 --> 00:00:04,976
This is Episode 48.

3
00:00:05,026 --> 00:00:06,221
It is night.

4
00:00:06,271 --> 00:00:07,791
Maya is asleep.

5
00:00:07,841 --> 00:00:09,825
A muddy blob tiptoes in.

6
00:00:09,875 --> 00:00:10,922
Oh no!

7
00:00:10,972 --> 00:00:12,288
Who is watching?

8
00:00:12,338 --> 00:00:13,691
The night watch!

9
00:00:13,741 --> 00:00:15,484
The watch owl sees him.

10
00:00:15,534 --> 00:00:16,459
Hoot!

11
00:00:16,509 --> 00:00:18,011
The blob runs.

12
00:00:18,061 --> 00:00:20,398
The crack glass hops along the wall.

13
00:00:20,448 --> 00:00:22,303
It finds a tiny crack.

14
00:00:22,353 --> 00:00:23,278
Ding!

15
00:00:23,328 --> 00:00:25,712
The secret lamp shines on the papers.

16
00:00:25,762 --> 00:00:27,236
One has a heart.

17
00:00:27,286 --> 00:00:28,174
Beep!

18
00:00:28,224 --> 00:00:29,837
That one is private.

19
00:00:29,887 --> 00:00:31,463
Now the big board.

20
00:00:31,513 --> 00:00:32,429
Owl.

21
00:00:32,479 --> 00:00:33,526
Glass.

22
00:00:33,576 --> 00:00:34,547
Lamp.

23
00:00:34,597 --> 00:00:36,062
Each pins a note.

24
00:00:36,112 --> 00:00:37,418
Three notes.

25
00:00:37,468 --> 00:00:38,682
One board.

26
00:00:38,732 --> 00:00:40,103
Morning comes.

27
00:00:40,153 --> 00:00:41,775
Maya reads the board.

28
00:00:41,825 --> 00:00:43,494
She fixes the crack.

29
00:00:43,544 --> 00:00:44,507
Easy.

30
00:00:44,557 --> 00:00:45,547
Watch.

31
00:00:45,597 --> 00:00:46,541
Check.

32
00:00:46,591 --> 00:00:47,609
Find.

33
00:00:47,659 --> 00:00:48,725
Report.

34
00:00:48,775 --> 00:00:50,462
That is the night watch.

35
00:00:50,512 --> 00:00:54,670
Now you know GuardDuty, Inspector, Macie, and Security Hub!

36
00:00:54,720 --> 00:00:58,000
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!
